{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18094","headline":"除官赴阙至江州寄鄂岳李大夫 · 韩愈","name":"除官赴阙至江州寄鄂岳李大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盆城去鄂渚，风便一日耳。\n不枉故人书，无因帆江水。\n故人辞礼闱，旌节镇江圻。\n而我窜逐者，龙锺初得归。\n别来已三岁，望望长迢递。\n咫尺不相闻，平生那可计。\n我齿落且尽，君鬓白几何。\n年皆过半百，来日苦无多。\n少年乐新知，衰暮思故友。\n譬如亲骨肉，宁免相可不。\n我昔实愚惷，不能降色辞。\n子犯亦有言，臣犹自知之。\n公其务贳过，我亦请改事。\n桑榆傥可收，愿寄相思字。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}